1
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,000
This place

2
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,400
is really nice.

3
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,860
How is it?

4
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,500
I didn't lie to you, did I?

5
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,790
I tasted this water.

6
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:51,720
It's sweet.

7
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,160
This water...

8
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:03,660
The color is wrong.

9
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:09,030
It wasn't like this when we came before.

10
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,830
It seems something is turning up from the bottom.

11
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:13,000
This dark red color

12
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:14,500
doesn't look like algae.

13
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,630
There's something in the lake.

14
00:01:19,730 --> 00:01:20,460
Wife.

15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:21,900
Wait for me.

16
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:34,590
Don't be afraid.

17
00:01:34,729 --> 00:01:35,560
I'll help you.

18
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,600
Wife.

19
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:46,460
Hold it down and don't let it move.

20
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:47,920
I'll deal with this grass.

21
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:48,900
You...

22
00:01:49,030 --> 00:01:49,960
Can you do it?

23
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:52,330
No matter how weird this grass is,

24
00:01:52,330 --> 00:01:53,400
it's still just grass.

25
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,200
You steady the deer.

26
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:54,860
I'll cut it.

27
00:02:37,130 --> 00:02:38,060
Alright.

28
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:39,100
It's fine now.

29
00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:42,860
What's wrong?

30
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:51,130
What are you doing?

31
00:02:58,630 --> 00:02:59,630
You little demon.

32
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,060
How dare you bite the hand that feeds you.

33
00:03:03,930 --> 00:03:05,500
She's just asleep.

34
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:06,660
Demon Lord.

35
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,760
You know me?

36
00:03:09,130 --> 00:03:10,530
Three hundred years ago,

37
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:13,730
during the battle at the border of the Heaven and Demon Realms,

38
00:03:13,730 --> 00:03:16,260
I strayed into the battlefield and was hit by a stray arrow.

39
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:19,260
You were the one who carried me out of the battlefield.

40
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:20,720
Then why did you...

41
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:23,329
The Heavenly Emperor slaughtered our Demon Tribe back then.

42
00:03:23,329 --> 00:03:25,860
Why is the Demon Lord still with her?

43
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:30,520
Because three hundred years ago,

44
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,060
she also saved me.

45
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:33,860
I see.

46
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:39,160
Later, the Heavenly Emperor Zhaohan feared her power would overshadow his,

47
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,530
so he stripped her of her divine bones

48
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:42,260
and cast her into the Demon Realm.

49
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,520
To repay her kindness,

50
00:03:44,260 --> 00:03:45,800
I have been guarding her all along.

51
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,600
But she

52
00:03:47,130 --> 00:03:48,660
has forgotten everything.

53
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:55,560
Demon Lord.

54
00:03:55,829 --> 00:03:57,100
You saved my life.

55
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,600
I know something

56
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,160
that might help you.

57
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,400
What is it?

58
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,800
The lake water changed color

59
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,160
because deep at the bottom of the lake,

60
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:08,560
a thousand-year-old Soul-Returning Grass is about to mature.

61
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,560
Its spiritual power is nourishing the entire lake.

62
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,460
But the aura emitted when this grass matures

63
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:14,030
will attract unclean things,

64
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:16,100
which is why the water color turned muddy.

65
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:18,200
The Soul-Returning Grass can repair broken divine veins

66
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,329
and awaken sealed ancient divine personas.

67
00:04:20,329 --> 00:04:22,300
If the God of War Baili can get this grass,

68
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,200
her divine power can be fully restored,

69
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,730
even stronger than before.

70
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:27,860
Soul-Returning Grass.

71
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:29,830
But there is a price.

72
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:33,730
What price?

73
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:36,060
When the medicinal power stimulates the recovery of the divine veins,

74
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:38,030
the lost memories will awaken simultaneously.

75
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:39,600
Everything from the past three hundred years,

76
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,600
without missing a single detail.

77
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,530
She will remember

78
00:04:41,530 --> 00:04:42,659
her entire past.

79
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,730
Where is that grass?

80
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:49,930
Right in the deepest rock crevice of this lake.

81
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:51,500
But the lake has been unusual these days.

82
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,060
I'm afraid it's not peaceful at the bottom.

83
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:55,460
And the Soul-Returning Grass is extremely rare.

84
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:57,600
Only this one has grown in nearly a thousand years.

85
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,930
If it is tainted by foul air,

86
00:04:58,930 --> 00:05:00,100
there won't be a second one.

87
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:01,230
Lord Demon Supreme.

88
00:05:01,330 --> 00:05:02,400
I owe you my life.

89
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,030
Consider this information as my repayment.

90
00:05:05,030 --> 00:05:06,600
But getting the grass is dangerous.

91
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,760
In your current state,

92
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,290
I'm afraid it won't be easy.

93
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:11,000
I know.

94
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:13,860
Thank you.

95
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:32,860
My Lord.

96
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:34,560
The location of the grass,

97
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,130
you heard it during the day.

98
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:37,430
The rock crevice at the bottom of the lake.

99
00:05:37,430 --> 00:05:39,360
Are you going personally, My Lord?

100
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,530
My Lord.

101
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:44,260
Your spiritual power hasn't recovered.

102
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,730
The foul air at the bottom is surging.

103
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:46,360
I'm afraid...

104
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,100
So you guard the shore for me.

105
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,090
If I don't come up in four hours,

106
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:52,730
go down and fish me out.

107
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:55,030
Yes.
